<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 24 million American-style call and put warrants, in eight equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	16.JUL.97	   PAYDATE	  03.JAN.97</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    100		SPOT REFERENCE $745.76</p>
<p>TEN WARRANTS REFER TO OME INDEX.</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	   STRIKE	 PRICE	PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	   $760	   $3.92	7.17 PCT   19.02 X</p>
<p> CALL	   $780	   $2.93	8.52 PCT   25.45 X</p>
<p> CALL	   $800	   $2.11	10.10 PCT  35.34 X</p>
<p> CALL	   $820	   $1.45	11.90 PCT  51.34 X</p>
<p> PUT	    $760	   $4.06	-3.53 PCT  18.37 X</p>
<p> PUT	    $780	   $5.09	-2.23 PCT  14.65 X</p>
<p> PUT	    $800	   $6.32	-1.20 PCT  11.80 X</p>
<p> PUT	    $820	   $7.78	-0.48 PCT  9.59 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
